              "Did Trump Just Scuttle US-China Trade Talks (Again)?Did Trump Just Scuttle US-China Trade Talks (Again)?\nBy Shannon Tiezzi\nTrump seems to think dialogue will continue despite new tariffs, now reaching all Chinese imports. China may disagree.\nEye for An Eye: China to Establish ‘Unreliable Entity List’\nEye for An Eye: China to Establish ‘Unreliable Entity List’\nBy Charlotte Gao\nThe move is obvious retaliation against U.S. ban on Huawei and U.S. companies are the ones to be punished"
